# Website Code Standards

- Read the root `AGENTS.md` first; it is the entry point for AI working discipline.
- For formal Website code, read `docs/10-development-plan/engineering-standards-v0.1.md` and apply the sections relevant to the task.
- Search for an existing implementation before creating a new one.
- Prefer native capabilities and genuine reuse.
- Keep concrete implementations until real repetition proves an abstraction.
- Keep semantic content server-first and Client Components local.
- Do not add a dependency without explicit task scope and dependency admission.
- Never claim an automated check has passed a human visual gate.
- Do not restate or override the detailed engineering baseline here.
